WEBVTT

00:01:28.204 --> 00:01:31.038
And he was only 52 years old.
Is that right?

00:01:31.246 --> 00:01:35.288
That's right. He was 52 years old. So
pretty young and quite surprising for us.

00:01:35.288 --> 00:01:39.913
And I'm sure, you know, many of us have
experienced something tragic like that

00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:44.496
or where the table cloth is pulled out
from under you and some things remain

00:01:44.496 --> 00:01:45.496
and some things fall off.

00:01:45.496 --> 00:01:48.121
And, you know, so I dropped
everything and moved home.

00:01:49.913 --> 00:01:51.746
That status, that paralysis.

00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:57.871
The condition of anxiety, of just
keeping myself busy, really,

00:01:57.871 --> 00:02:00.954
to avoid thinking deeply about what
this loss might actually mean.